appendp('13. UI Design and Customer Journeys',True,True)
appendp('Use a warm ivory background, deep maroon primary actions and restrained saffron accents. A geometric sun mark is a proposed placeholder until the client supplies a logo. Use system Devanagari fonts and generous line height; keep all inputs and touch targets at least 44 pixels high.')
appendtable([['Screen','Primary action','Required states'],['Home','Ask AI Guruji or create a birth chart','Marathi welcome, language control, usage summary'],['Birth Chart','Confirm birth data and generate','Missing or unknown time, place selection, loading, unavailable'],['AI Guruji','Ask and follow up','Profile needed, thinking, sourced response, quota exhausted'],['Vastu','Submit directions and room details','Missing direction, traditional guidance, practical advice'],['Prashna','Confirm question time and place','Method not enabled, confirmation, calculation failure'],['Plans','Choose a 30-day prepaid plan','Current plan, pending payment, confirmed payment'],['Consultation','Open WhatsApp','Consultant profile; separate human consultation fee']])
appendp('Navigation: Home, Guruji, Birth Chart, Vastu and More. More contains Prashna, Plans and Contact. On desktop, show these sections in a persistent sidebar. A language switch preserves the current flow and local input values; translate app copy with react-i18next and Ant Design component labels with ConfigProvider.')
appendp('The prototype is a local interactive design, not a live service. It demonstrates all seven screens in Marathi, Hindi and English. Forms show a safe provider-unavailable state; no astrological results, payments or authentication are simulated as successful.')
appendp('Detailed output layout: verified calculation summary, traditional interpretation, practical considerations, limits and consultation action. Display provider and calculation timestamp. Never show fabricated chart geometry or planetary values while loading. Unknown birth time blocks ascendant and time-sensitive conclusions.')
appendp('Accessibility: visible focus, semantic labels, readable contrast, status announcements, keyboard access and error text next to the affected field. Respect reduced motion. Test at 360 px, 390 px and desktop widths with long Marathi labels.')
appendp('14. Backend Interfaces and Data Model',True,True)
appendtable([['Interface','Purpose','Controls'],['POST /v1/profiles','Save birth data and confirmed location','Ownership, consent, timezone validation'],['POST /v1/charts','Create or reuse a verified chart','Chart allowance; complete cache key'],['POST /v1/chat','Submit question or follow-up','AI allowance; session ownership; context limit'],['POST /v1/vastu','Basic directional assessment','Vastu allowance; validated directions'],['POST /v1/prashna','Question-time chart workflow','Feature flag; consultant-approved method'],['POST /v1/checkout','Create provider payment order','Server price and plan version'],['POST /v1/webhooks/razorpay','Verify and reconcile payment events','Raw-body signature; deduplication'],['GET /v1/me/usage','Show current period and allowances','Authenticated user only']])
appendp('Firestore collections: users/{uid}, profiles/{id}, conversations/{id}/messages/{id}, results/{id}, entitlements/{uid}, usage/{uid_period}, operations/{uid_requestId}, payments/{paymentId}, webhookEvents/{eventId}, and versioned plans/{planId}. Store ownerUid on owned records; use server timestamps and validate collection-specific rules.')
appendp('Birth profile: local date and exact time, selected place label, latitude, longitude, IANA timezone, UTC instant and time certainty. Cache keys include normalized inputs, ayanamsa, chart settings, provider and calculation version. Natal data can be reused; transits and Panchang require date-sensitive keys and expiry.')
appendp('AstrologyAPI adapter: geo_details, timezone_with_dst, astro_details, planets, horo_chart/:chart_id, major_vdasha and current_vdasha form the proposed chart bundle. Guruji uses hosted /api/chat with Standard or Advanced level. Basic Vastu uses score, findings and remedies. Confirm exact routes, auth, response shapes and language support in M1.')
appendp('Payment flow: create order, complete checkout, show pending, receive signed webhook, verify captured payment and matching amount/currency, then activate a 30-day period atomically. Do not activate from a browser success callback. For MVP, prohibit overlapping purchases; refunds and disputes require recorded entitlement adjustments.')
appendp('15  Commercial Model and Sources',True,True)
appendp('Planning estimates carried forward from the pricing discussion on 17 October 2026. Validate the live vendor catalogue before purchase. AstrologyAPI hosted chat is the AI layer; a separate OpenAI or Gemini invoice is not included. Prices exclude applicable taxes and acquisition costs.')
appendtable([['Plan and price','30-day allowance','Contribution at full use'],['Free INR 0','Lifetime: 3 AI questions and 1 chart','Cost INR 2.16 per activated trial'],['Basic INR 49','20 Standard AI, 1 chart, 1 Vastu','INR 36.12 or 73.7%'],['Standard INR 149','75 Standard AI, 3 charts, 3 Vastu','INR 102.80 or 69.0%'],['Premium INR 349','150 AI; 5 charts; 5 Vastu','INR 211.48 or 60.6%']])
appendp('Assumptions: chart bundle INR 0.66; Standard chat INR 0.50 per question; Advanced INR 0.80; basic Vastu bundle INR 0.75; payment reserve 3%. Each follow-up counts. Cached viewing is free; changed inputs count as a new calculation. No rollover. Contribution excludes fixed maintenance and build recovery.')
appendp('Monthly scenario: 50 Basic, 35 Standard, 15 Premium and 100 new Free users. Revenue INR 12,900; API budget INR 4,200–4,700; Firebase INR 0–500; domain annualized INR 100–150; maintenance INR 1,500–2,500; payment reserve INR 387. Operating surplus INR 4,663–6,713 before taxes, marketing and development recovery. This is not guaranteed profit.')
appendp('Developer proposal: INR 45,000 one time, split INR 18,000 / 18,000 / 9,000, with 30 days of defect fixes. Then INR 1,500–2,500 monthly for agreed support hours; new features quoted separately. Vendor bills belong to the client. A sub-INR 10,000 budget requires a smaller unpaid pilot.')
appendp('Firebase uses Blaze billing for backend functions. Small-pilot estimates: Firestore INR 0–150; Hosting INR 0–100; Functions, secrets and logs INR 0–250. Google sign-in avoids SMS charges. Domain registration is separate and the proposed domain has not been checked for availability.')
appendp('Sources: astrologyapi.com/credits-calculator; astrologyapi.com/developers/v1/chat-api; astrologyapi.com/developers/v1/guides/pay-as-you-go; firebase.google.com/pricing; razorpay.com/pricing. Hosted chat rates may be introductory. Marathi quality, Prashna compatibility and any additional endpoint costs remain launch gates.')
